{"data":[{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-09-03T12:25:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1698311227120959731"],"id":"1698311227120959731","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":13,"impression_count":24517,"like_count":29,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"text":"日本风业俗的痛点有很多\n1.语言不通聊不明白\n2.照片选人货不对板\n3.上门服务没有本番\n4.夜总会选人不能海选\n5.夜总会结束不能带走\n6.直来直去没有感情\n7.难以后续发展关系\n8.服务潦草应付了事\n9.价格涨跌随心所欲\n但是最近我们尝试了很多次之后，终于找到了解决以上所有痛点的玩法...🥹","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1698311227120959731"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-09-02T02:56:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1697805700129542225"],"id":"1697805700129542225","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":27593,"like_count":55,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":1},"text":"这次喊来的妹子质量真的高，最主要的是可以不花钱带走... https://t.co/d2alDPOPmI","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1697805700129542225"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-08-29T19:56:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1696612809772241360"],"id":"1696612809772241360","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":33260,"like_count":21,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":4},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1696454759002341707","type":"quoted"}],"text":"这电视台一播出，都尼玛成笑话了... https://t.co/Rlwf1sQJVx","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1696612809772241360"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-08-28T13:19:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1696150441925705793"],"id":"1696150441925705793","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":19038,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"龙猫森林 https://t.co/5UOJPLYBNj","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1696150441925705793"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-08-27T12:03:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1695768910761697569"],"id":"1695768910761697569","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":24096,"like_count":49,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":0},"text":"到福岛了，必须来点海鲜 https